  "details": "I've seen several people complain about a bug that causes time out errors. I do not know what is causing this issue it happens randomly.\n\nEffects:\n\nFriends will tell me that my audio is cutting out.  I can still hear them clearly. \n\nHere is an example of what my friends hear: https://www.youtube.com/live/aOcC5SCoro8?si=yHi_Abv5u_5JF7sh&t=8382 Time stamped to 2:19:43.\n\nMy client then times out and the world attemps to reload, only for it to take an exceedingly long time and then immediately times out again. \n\nLate last night I just resorted to closing the app and restarting when timed out, hence the multiple short outputlogs.",
